   "lines": [
    "Have finally decided",
    "to go into the",
    "Porcellian; my classmates",
    "who are in it are",
    "Minot Weld, Harry",
    "Shaw, Dick Trimble,",
    "Charley Morgan and",
    "George Griswold.",
    "The A.D men from our",
    "class are Bob Bacon,",
    "Billy Hooper, Billy",
    "Blodgett, Charley Ware,",
    "Harry Jackson and",
    "Freddy Allen &",
    "Johnny Samson."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "medium",
   "note": "'A.D' may be written with a delta-like A; final '&' uncertain"
